@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to build a station
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives the request, shows the available types \n and asks for the coordinates and the centre
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : selects the type and writes the XY coordinates
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives and validates the coordinates and checks if the terrain \n selected is occupied, asks for the centre (in case of Station), \n and suggests a name for the station based on the closest city
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : types the centre compass coordinate (if Station is chosen)\n and the wanted station name (if not following the recommendation)
    activate System

    System --> Editor : receives and shows all data and requests confirmation
        deactivate System

        Editor -> System : confirms data
        activate System

        System --> Editor : builds the requested station and displays success
        deactivate System


@enduml